---

Shady Merchant: Oh hello there.  
Shady Merchant: You're a goblin? That's rare... not many of those left around these parts anymore.

->What do you mean?
    Shady Merchant: What do I mean? The first war wiped out most of the goblins, that's what I mean.

Shady Merchant: You don't look so good... where were you the past few years?

->Oh yeah, I was on a treasure hunt. What happened while I was gone?
    Shady Merchant: Treasure hunting? And all you came back with is that rusty sword? Some treasure hunter you are.  
    Shady Merchant: While you were off chasing gold, the world changed. A new Empire rose up.  
    Shady Merchant: An Evil King is burning down everything that isn't his. Whole cities—gone.

Shady Merchant: Anyway... do you even remember how to move? You know W, A, S, D to walk around?

Shady Merchant: What about attacking? Try Right Mouse Click. Yeah, that's it.

Shady Merchant: Listen, broke boy, if you do find some real treasure, come find me in town.  
Shady Merchant: I'll sell you some REAL weaponry. 

-> Thanks... I guess?
    Shady Merchant: Just don’t die before you make it to town. The monsters have invaded the forest.

===
